---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /precast-concrete-molds/index.html
pageType: precast-moulds
title: Precast Concrete Moulds & Formwork | Realjet
seoTitle: Precast Concrete Moulds & Steel Formwork | Realjet
description: Explore project-specific steel moulds and formwork for precast bridge, building, tunnel and municipal concrete components.
canonical: https://realjetech.com/precast-concrete-molds/
socialImage: https://realjetech.com/images/products/precast-moulds/precast-concrete-moulds-hero.webp
robots: index, follow
---
<article class="moulds-landing">
  <section class="moulds-hero">
    <img class="moulds-hero-background" src="/images/products/precast-moulds/precast-concrete-moulds-hero.webp" data-random-hero data-hero-sources="/images/products/precast-moulds/precast-concrete-moulds-hero.webp|/images/products/precast-moulds/precast-concrete-moulds-hero-2.webp|/images/products/precast-moulds/precast-concrete-moulds-hero-3.webp" alt="" width="1530" height="690" aria-hidden="true" decoding="async" />
    <div class="container moulds-hero-shell">
      <div class="moulds-hero-grid">
        <div class="moulds-hero-copy">
          <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span aria-current="page">Precast Concrete Moulds</span></nav>
          <span class="eyebrow">Project-Specific Steel Mould Systems</span>
          <h1>Precast Concrete Moulds &amp; Formwork</h1>
          <p>Reusable steel mould systems engineered around the component geometry, casting sequence, production layout and project requirements of each precast operation.</p>
          <div class="moulds-hero-actions">
            <a class="button button-primary" href="#mould-catalogue" data-mould-cta="explore_products">Explore Products <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
            <button class="button button-outline" type="button" data-universal-enquiry data-enquiry-keyword="Precast concrete moulds technical review">Request a Technical Review <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
          </div>
          <ul class="moulds-proof-list" aria-label="Planning basis">
            <li>Factory or casting-yard use</li>
            <li>Mechanical or hydraulic operation</li>
            <li>Made to approved drawings</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav class="mould-scenario-nav" aria-label="Application scenarios">
        <div>
          {% for category in precastMouldCatalog.categories %}<a href="#{{ category.slug }}" data-mould-category="{{ category.slug }}">{{ category.name }}</a>{% endfor %}
        </div>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="mould-catalogue" class="mould-catalogue" aria-labelledby="mould-catalogue-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading mould-catalogue-heading"><span class="eyebrow">Product Catalogue</span><h2 id="mould-catalogue-title">14 Precast Mould Systems</h2></div>
      {% for category in precastMouldCatalog.categories %}
      {% set categoryProducts = collections.publishedMouldProducts | mouldProductsForCategory(category.slug) %}
      <section class="mould-category-products" id="{{ category.slug }}" aria-labelledby="{{ category.slug }}-title">
        <div class="mould-category-products-heading"><h3 id="{{ category.slug }}-title"><a href="/precast-concrete-molds/{{ category.slug }}/">{{ category.name }}</a></h3></div>
        <div class="mould-products-grid" style="--mould-columns: {{ categoryProducts.length }}">{% for mouldProduct in categoryProducts %}{% include "components/mould-product-card.njk" %}{% endfor %}</div>
      </section>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="mould-enquiry" class="mould-enquiry mould-enquiry-cta" aria-labelledby="mould-enquiry-title">
    <div class="container mould-enquiry-shell">
      <div class="mould-enquiry-copy"><span class="eyebrow">Project Enquiry</span><h2 id="mould-enquiry-title">Send the component type and available drawings.</h2><p>Realjet will review the mould geometry, operating sequence, production target and factory or casting-yard interfaces before defining the technical scope.</p></div>
      <button class="button button-primary" type="button" data-universal-enquiry data-enquiry-keyword="Precast concrete moulds general enquiry">Start an Enquiry <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
    </div>
  </section>
</article>
